# Tracer: TanSquareReciprocalCosine with real inputs and the original partial-operation guards.
# Before: legacy accepted; current equality search rejected this exact source.
# forall x R:
#     cos(x)!=0
#     =>:
#         1+tan(x)^2=1/cos(x)^2
# Now: fixed identity leaf after complete parent WD; no premise search or fuel reset.
forall x R:
    cos(x)!=0
    =>:
        1+tan(x)^2=1/cos(x)^2

forall x R:
    cos(x)!=0
    =>:
        1/(cos(x)*cos(x))=tan(x)*tan(x)+1

